Perfect! I have gathered comprehensive information about the codebase. Let me create a detailed summary report with all the findings.

## Comprehensive Codebase Exploration Report

I've thoroughly explored the Cloak and Dagger codebase. Here are my detailed findings:

---

## 1. Navigation/Routes Structure

**Key File:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/@types/navigation.d.ts`

The Routes type is a comprehensive discriminated union that defines all registered screens:

```typescript
type Routes = {
  splash: undefined;
  login: undefined;
  home: undefined;
  welcome: undefined;
  onboarding: undefined;
  room: { roomId: string };
  roomDetails: { room: RoomInterface };
  roomMembers: { members: RoomMember[]; roomId: string };
  roomMedia: { room: RoomInterface };
  roomNotifications: undefined;
  settings: undefined;
  userProfile: undefined;
  profile: { userId: string };
  notifications: undefined;
  invitePeople: { roomId: string; members: RoomMember[]; isCreateRoom?: boolean };
  createRoom: undefined;
  editRoom: { room: RoomInterface };
  sendImages: { roomId: string; images: Asset[] };
  elementCall: { roomId: string; roomName?: string };
  forwardMessage: { currentRoomId: string };
  reportMessage: { roomId: string };
  blockedUsers: { blockedUserIds: string[] };
  // ... and many more
};
```

**Navigation Setup File:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/modules/navigation/components/root-navigator/RootNavigator.tsx`

All screens are registered as `Stack.Screen` components using React Navigation's `createStackNavigator`. Key points:
- Uses `TransitionPresets.ModalPresentationIOS` for modal screens
- Modal screens include: `serverSelect`, `verifyUser`, `cantConfirm`, `startChat`, `invitePeople`, `createRoom`, `elementCall`, `setUpRecoveryKey`, `forwardMessage`, `reportMessage`, `blockedUsers`
- Regular screens use standard navigation transitions

**Exports:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/index.ts` exports all 40+ screens

---

## 2. Room Details Screen Structure

**Location:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/room-details/`

**Main File:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/room-details/RoomDetails.tsx`

**Fragments/Components:**
- `/src/screens/room-details/fragments/action-buttons/ActionButtons.tsx` - Call, Mute, Share buttons
- `/src/screens/room-details/fragments/encryption-status/EncryptionStatus.tsx` - Encryption state display
- `/src/screens/room-details/fragments/topic/Topic.tsx` - Room topic display/editing
- `/src/screens/room-details/leave-room/LeaveRoom.tsx` - Leave room button

**Key Structure:**
```typescript
export const RoomDetails: React.FC<NativeStackScreenProps<Routes, "roomDetails">> = 
  ({ navigation, route }) => {
  const { room } = route.params;
  const [roomInfo, setRoomInfo] = useState<RoomInfo | undefined>(undefined);
  const [userPowerLevel, setUserPowerLevel] = useState<number | null>(null);
  const isAdmin = useMemo(() => userPowerLevel === 100, [userPowerLevel]);
```

Uses `SettingsListItem` components for navigation items like:
- Notifications
- Members (for groups) / View profile (for DMs)
- Media and files
- Pinned events

---

## 3. SettingsListItem Component

**Location:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/settings/fragments/settings-list-item/SettingsListItem.tsx`

**Props:**
```typescript
type SettingsListItemProps = {
  title: string;
  icon?: ImageSourcePropType;
  showSeparator?: boolean;
  onPress: () => void;
};
```

**Implementation:**
- Wraps content in `Button.Wrapper` for pressability
- Displays icon on the left (24x24)
- Shows title text
- Auto-rotated caret icon on the right
- Optional separator line (border-bottom)
- Uses `@prototyp/skeletor` Block and Text components
- Colors from `shared/styles/Colors`

---

## 4. Existing Modal Patterns

**Bottom Sheet Pattern** (using `@gorhom/bottom-sheet`):

1. **MemberDetailsBottomSheet** - `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/shared/components/member-details-bottom-sheet/MemberDetailsBottomSheet.tsx`
   - Used in room members list to show member actions
   - Features: View profile, Remove user, Ban user, Unban user
   - Uses Alert.prompt() for confirmation dialogs
   - Has fade-in animation overlay

2. **MessageContentBottomSheet** - `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/room/fragments/message-content-bottom-sheet/MessageContentBottomSheet.tsx`
   - Shows on long-press message actions
   - Features: Reply, Edit, Pin, Forward, Report, Copy
   - Uses jotai atoms for state management

3. **SendInviteBottomSheet** - `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/start-chat/fragments/send-invite-bottom-sheet/SendInviteBottomSheet.tsx`

**Modal Pattern** (using React Native Modal):

1. **BlockUserModal** - `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/profile/fragments/block-user-modal/BlockUserModal.tsx`
   - Simple overlay modal with confirm/cancel buttons
   - Uses `Modal` component with `transparent` and `animationType="fade"`
   - Black70 background overlay

2. **DisableKeyStorageModal** - `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/encryption/fragments/disable-ley-storage/DisableKeyStorageModal.tsx`

**Common Patterns:**
- Fade-in animations using `@prototyp/skeletor`'s `animateSequence`
- Black overlay background (`Colors.black70`)
- Gestures handled with `useAndroidBackHandler`
- `usePreventSwipeBack` hook for iOS
- Toast notifications for feedback

---

## 5. MatrixService - Power Levels & Member Management

**Location:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/modules/matrix-client/services/matrix-service.ts`

**Key Power Level Methods:**

```typescript
// Get member power level (user's own if userId not provided)
public static getUserPowerLevel = async (roomId: string, userId?: string) => {
  const room = this.instance.getRoom(roomId);
  const member = await room.member(userId ?? this.instance.userId());
  return Number(
    member.powerLevel.tag === PowerLevel_Tags.Value
      ? member.powerLevel.inner.value
      : 0,
  );
};
```

**User Management Methods:**

```typescript
public static removeUserFromRoom = async (
  roomId: string,
  userId: string,
  reason?: string,
) => {
  const room = this.instance.getRoom(roomId);
  await room.kickUser(userId, reason);
  await this.refreshRoomList();
};

public static banUserFromRoom = async (
  roomId: string,
  userId: string,
  reason?: string,
) => {
  const room = this.instance.getRoom(roomId);
  await room.banUser(userId, reason);
  await this.refreshRoomList();
};

public static unbanUserFromRoom = async (
  roomId: string,
  userId: string,
  reason?: string,
) => {
  const room = this.instance.getRoom(roomId);
  await room.unbanUser(userId, reason);
  await this.refreshRoomList();
};
```

**Other Relevant Methods:**
- `getRoomInfo(roomId)` - Get room interface
- `getRooms()` - Get all rooms
- `blockUser(userId)` - Block/ignore user
- `unblockUser(userId)` - Unblock user
- `getBlockedUsers()` - Get list of blocked users

---

## 6. Matrix SDK Types

**RoomMember Type** (imported from `@unomed/react-native-matrix-sdk`):
- `userId: string` - Matrix user ID
- `displayName?: string` - Display name
- `avatarUrl?: string` - Avatar URL
- `membership?: { tag: MembershipState_Tags }` - Membership state (Join, Invite, Ban, Leave)
- `powerLevel: { tag: PowerLevel_Tags; inner?: { value: bigint } }` - Power level info

**MembershipState_Tags Enum:**
- `Join` - Active member
- `Invite` - Pending invitation
- `Ban` - Banned member
- `Leave` - Left/removed member

**PowerLevel_Tags:**
- `Value` - Numeric power level (wrapped in bigint)
- Other states for users without explicit power levels

**MemberDetailsPayload Type** (`/src/@types/timeline.d.ts`):
```typescript
interface MemberDetailsPayload {
  userId: string;
  displayName: string;
  avatarUrl: string | null;
  membershipTag?: MembershipTag;
}
```

---

## 7. Room Members Screen

**Location:** `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/screens/room-members/RoomMembers.tsx`

**Key Features:**
- Receives `members` array and `roomId` as params
- Filters members into sections:
  - **Pending** - Invited members (tag: Invite)
  - **Active** - Joined members (tag: Join)
  - **Banned** - Banned members (tag: Ban)
- Uses `SectionList` for organized display
- Tap member → opens `MemberDetailsBottomSheet`
- Refresh functionality with `room.members()` API
- Power level checks to show admin-only actions

**State Management:**
```typescript
const pendingMembers = useMemo(
  () => members.filter(m => m.membership?.tag === MembershipState_Tags.Invite),
  [members],
);
const acceptedMembers = useMemo(
  () => members.filter(m => m.membership?.tag === MembershipState_Tags.Join),
  [members],
);
const bannedMembers = useMemo(
  () => members.filter(m => m.membership?.tag === MembershipState_Tags.Ban),
  [members],
);
```

**Member Actions:**
- View profile
- Remove user (admin only)
- Ban user (admin only)
- Unban user (admin only, if banned)

---

## 8. Shared Components & Hooks

**Shared Components** (`/src/shared/components/`):
- `Button` - Main button component with variants (Primary, Secondary, Ghost, Warning, Outline, OutlinePrimary, Wrapper)
- `MemberDetailsBottomSheet` - Member action modal
- `GoBackHeader` - Header with back button
- `ScreenLayout` - Layout wrapper
- `UserImage` - User avatar display
- `RoomImage` - Room avatar display
- `Loading` - Loading spinner
- `Input` - Text input component
- `RadioButton`, `CheckButton` - Selection components
- `SeenBy` - "Seen by" indicators
- `ImageViewerModal`, `VideoViewerModal` - Media viewers
- `PinIndicator` - Pin status indicator
- `MessageTimestamp` - Message timestamp display

**Shared Hooks** (`/src/shared/hooks/`):
- `useMemberDetails()` - Manages member details bottom sheet state
- `useLeaveRoom()` - Handles room leaving with confirmation dialogs
- `useUploadPhoto()` - Photo upload functionality
- `usePreventSwipeBack()` - Prevents iOS swipe-back gestures
- `useNavigateToCorrectScreenHelper()` - Navigation helper

---

## 9. App Architecture

**Main App Provider Stack** (`App.tsx`):
```
SafeAreaProvider
  SkeletorProvider
    GestureHandlerRootView
      BottomSheetModalProvider (for modals)
        AudioPlaybackProvider
          NavigationContainer
            CallKitProvider
            VerificationProvider
            RoomListProvider
            PushNotificationsProvider
            RootNavigator (all screens)
            Toast (notifications)
```

**Key Providers:**
- `BottomSheetModalProvider` - Bottom sheets
- `RoomListProvider` - Room list state
- `VerificationProvider` - Device verification
- `PushNotificationsProvider` - Push notifications
- `CallKitProvider` - VoIP calls

---

## Summary of Key File Paths

| Component | Path |
|-----------|------|
| Routes Type | `/src/@types/navigation.d.ts` |
| RootNavigator | `/src/modules/navigation/components/root-navigator/RootNavigator.tsx` |
| Room Details Screen | `/src/screens/room-details/RoomDetails.tsx` |
| Room Members Screen | `/src/screens/room-members/RoomMembers.tsx` |
| SettingsListItem | `/src/screens/settings/fragments/settings-list-item/SettingsListItem.tsx` |
| MemberDetailsBottomSheet | `/src/shared/components/member-details-bottom-sheet/MemberDetailsBottomSheet.tsx` |
| MatrixService | `/src/modules/matrix-client/services/matrix-service.ts` |
| Timeline Types | `/src/@types/timeline.d.ts` |
| App Root | `/App.tsx` |

This comprehensive structure provides a solid foundation for understanding how to implement new features, particularly around member management, power levels, and modal interactions in the room details and members screens.
